    "description": "Tobacco Pipe Lot - 4 Pieces\nMixed Estate Styles, Briar Wood and Rusticated Finishes\nVintage Collection\nThis lot features four vintage estate tobacco pipes, showcasing a variety of classic shapes and finishes popular throughout the mid-to-late 20th century. The collection includes both smooth briar wood and textured rusticated surfaces, representing a range of traditional pipe craftsmanship. These pieces are ideal for collectors of smoking memorabilia or enthusiasts looking to restore and enjoy classic estate pipes.\nLot of four individual tobacco pipes in varying sizes and shapes\nIncludes three smooth-finish pipes and one rusticated (textured) finish pipe\nStems include classic black and one translucent amber-colored acrylic or lucite variant\nOne pipe features a decorative silver-toned metal band on the shank\nCondition:\nOverall lot shows signs of previous use consistent with vintage estate pipes. Bowls exhibit carbon buildup and charring from smoking. Stems show typical oxidation and light tooth chatter marks. The wood surfaces retain good color with minor scuffs and surface wear visible. The metal band shows light tarnishing. Items are sold as-is for collection or restoration.\nTHANK YOU FOR YOUR PURCHASE!\nIf you’re happy and you know it, please leave a 5-star rating! If there is a problem with your order, please contact us via Shop Goodwill before opening returns/claims. We strive to return all messages within one business day.\nPlease click the shipping estimate link in the listing to get the shipping costs directly from FedEx.  There will be no discounts or price changes after an auction has ended.\nOur shipping team works hard to get out all orders as quickly as possible, that being said it may take up to 5 business days after payment for your order to ship out.  Once it ships out you will receive tracking information.\n***IMPORTANT*** If your item was damaged in transit, do not throw away anything, including the box or packing materials until we have authorized you to do so. Photos will be required to file insurance claims.\nOur Business hours: Monday - Friday  8:00 am to 4:00 pm Central\nNew items and unique treasures are added daily, come back soon!",
